# What never needs uploading to a deployment.
#
# `vercel --prod` uploads the working directory, and this one holds a 703MB
# copy of an older version of the project — complete with its own node_modules
# and a zip of itself — which alone exceeds Vercel's 100MB limit and fails the
# deploy before it starts. Ignoring it here rather than deleting it, because
# whether that backup is still wanted is not a build-tool decision.
_old_backup_to_delete/
_to_delete/

# Rebuilt on the server; uploading them wastes the limit on bytes that are
# discarded on arrival.
node_modules/
.next/

# Local only.
.env*
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
